  "description": "Numerics.NET (formerly Extreme Optimization Numerical Libraries for .NET) are a set of libraries for numerical computing and data analysis.\n\nThis is the main package that contains all the core functionality.\n\nFor native acceleration, use MKL on Windows/Linux or Accelerate on macOS. OpenBLAS is available separately as a portable alternative.\n\nSupports .NET 8, 9, 10, 11, .NET Framework 4.6.2+, .NET Standard 2.0 on Windows, Linux and macOS.",
